ADDITIONAL MARITIME SAFETY, SCOPE & NON-AFFILIATION NOTICE
================================================================================

1. TRAINING ONLY / NOT FOR MARINE NAVIGATION:
   This software is a synthetic classroom training simulator ONLY. It MUST NOT
   be used for real-world marine navigation, depth sounding, collision
   avoidance, route planning, safety-of-life decisions, or connection to any
   operational shipboard sensor, transducer, NMEA bus, AIS transponder, radar,
   or ECDIS equipment.

2. NOT AFFILIATED WITH OR ENDORSED BY MANUFACTURERS:
   NOT AFFILIATED WITH OR ENDORSED BY FURUNO, KODEN, TRANSPONDERTECH,
   RAYMARINE, TRANSAS, OR WÄRTSILÄ. All product names, model numbers, and
   trademarks referenced for educational identification belong to their
   respective owners. No hardware equivalence, installed-firmware conformance,
   or manufacturer certification is claimed (`releaseApproval = HOLD`).

3. REFERENCE MANUALS & HARDWARE PHOTOGRAPHS:
   The MIT License above applies to the simulator software source code,
